# env.required — vars without which the skill's scripts cannot run.
# None: competitor page fetch is keyless (public HTTP / headless render), and all
# positioning synthesis is done by the host agent (the agent is the model — no LLM key is
# consumed by any script here).
#
# Runtime prerequisite for the JS fallback (not an env var): Chromium for Playwright —
#   npx playwright install chromium
